[{"title":"题融师松斋","author":"张舜民","text":"未解子荆流可枕，冷笑陶令琴无弦。\n临流有耳安用洗，续弦得胶还自煎。\n不禁巢边黄口闹，不作竿上鲇鱼缘。\n但欲移床倚西壁，共师饱听松风眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56170,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题薛判官秋溪烟竹","author":"张舜民","text":"深墨画竹竹明白，淡墨画竹竹带烟。\n高堂忽尔开数幅，半隐半见如自然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56171,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"燕山闻杜鹃","author":"张舜民","text":"晓色千峰杳未分，声声哀怨出云根。\n举头忽见思乡岭，何不他时别处闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56172,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠奉议沈辽诗","author":"张舜民","text":"凫胫天生短，鹤胫本来长。\n一朝有客欲断续，二物无地逃悲伤。\n吾徒曾匪凫鹤匹，又取圣贤为学术。\n解将轩冕等浮云，宁免傥来并执一。\n夫君擢秀居东南，代以文词起簪绂。\n铮铮官业素有闻，更号能书居第一。\n平生意气少防闲，一跌落在江湖间。\n几年转徙无家室，唯与樵渔为往还。\n醉吟未免写胸臆，健笔依旧飞云烟。\n远俗僻陋多不识，都城一帖沽万钱。\n今朝我过齐山下，邀我陟降游二山。\n羡君卜筑思意尽，今古气象罗目前。\n佛留九顶千株石，天赐清溪一水湾。\n自拾薪枝给朝夕，不与城郭通交关。\n亲友一切皆谢绝，惟许子驰来问安。\n人生涉世多忧喜，不用昭昭明物理。\n少小辛苦卜一廛，如今老大无居止。\n迁流方从五岭去，敢望生还复经此。\n万一君恩纵北归，与君左右为邻里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56173,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲸鱼","author":"张舜民","text":"东海十日风，巨浪碎山谷。\n长鲸跨十寻，宛转在平陆。\n雷火从天来，砉然刳两目。\n肌肤煮作油，骨节分为屋。\n腥膻百里内，户户至厌足。\n我闻海上人，明珠可作烛。\n鲸鱼复何罪，海若一何酷。\n从欲谗风伯，大钧问不告。\n踌躇复叹息，归咎当溟渎。\n托形天地间，独尔有含蓄。\n大者不能容，小者又何益。\n却羡虾鱼辈，安然保家族。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56174,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"癸亥陈和叔会于赏心亭 江神子","author":"张舜民","text":"七朝文物旧江山。\n水如天。\n莫凭栏。\n千古斜阳、无处认长安。\n更隔秦淮闻旧曲，秋已半，夜将阑。\n争教潘鬓不生斑。\n敛芳颜。\n抹么弦。\n须记琵琶、子细说因缘。\n待得鸾胶肠已断，重别日，是何年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56175,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岳阳楼二首 其二 卖花声","author":"张舜民","text":"楼上久踟躇。\n地远身孤。\n拟将憔悴吊三闾。\n自是长安日下影，流落江湖。\n烂醉且消除。\n不醉何如。\n又看暝色满平芜。\n试问寒沙新到雁，应有来书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56176,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岳阳楼二首 其一 卖花声","author":"张舜民","text":"木叶下君山。\n空水漫漫。\n十分斟酒敛芳颜。\n不是渭城西去客，休唱阳关。\n醉袖抚危栏。\n天淡云闲。\n何人此路得生还。\n回首夕阳红尽处，应是长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56177,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清遐台饯别 朝中措","author":"张舜民","text":"三湘迁客思悠哉。\n樽俎定常开。\n云雨未消歌伴，山川忍对离杯。\n他年来此，贤侯未去，忍话先回。\n好在江南山色，恁时重上高台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56178,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"张舜民","text":"万里秋风吹鬓发，百年人事倚栏干。\n知他落日能多少，偏照淮南几处山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56179,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"张谟","text":"佳岭花光纷似雪，荔江波色绿于苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56180,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"圣水寺","author":"张道","text":"圣水山南莲萼辉，徘徊花下蝶双飞。\n春风助我晨游兴，月上层峦照拂衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56181,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终偈","author":"张道成","text":"七十四年命幻身，临行动众动群伦。\n鸣钟击鼓浑闲事，一点圆明不动真。\n咦！\n擘破乾坤一玄牝，挐将日影挂林梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56182,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉华寺","author":"张道宗","text":"殿阁依山古，寻春闲客行。\n谁知唐帝馆，今在梵王城。\n禾黍伤时变，松篁入夜清。\n惟馀碧岩溜，依旧昔年声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56183,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉华山","author":"张道宗","text":"玉华山形郁崷崒，白昼莽苍常生烟。\n近村百家湿翠黛，阴崖千尺淙寒泉。\n山根宛转抱河曲，河流倒影浸碧巅。\n文皇性热不奈暑，当时宫此安徒然。\n得非遍选天下胜，莫如兹地无烦喧。\n暂游已骇非俗骨，久驻直恐成真仙。\n何当借得神画笔，霜绡十幅图孱颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56184,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"千叶梅","author":"张道洽","text":"应怯春寒悄，重重叠叠衣。\n本来飞燕瘦，翻作玉环肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56185,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆梅","author":"张道洽","text":"到得芳天闹众葩，相思一夜鬓成华。\n阆风归去无消息，梦寐犹应见此花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56186,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见梅","author":"张道洽","text":"寒梅冲雪领春回，桃李纷纷趁脚来。\n一点阳和无尽处，从头分与百花开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56187,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对梅 其二","author":"张道洽","text":"一点春风天正冬，不妨花下倒金钟。\n扳条拣蕊轻轻折，只嗅清香醉杀侬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56188,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对梅 其三","author":"张道洽","text":"数点枝头黏白玉，一年春意动黄钟。\n为渠拚受风流罪，只恐风流不到侬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56189,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对梅 其一","author":"张道洽","text":"老年不著梅花眼，得见梅花子细看。\n我不似梅梅似我，风流心事一般般。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56190,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对梅 其四","author":"张道洽","text":"秋水娟娟隔美人，江东日暮几重云。\n孤灯竹屋霜清夜，梦到梅花即见君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56191,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访梅","author":"张道洽","text":"梅花欲放绕溪行，隔水香来分外清。\n拄杖过桥寻欲遍，竹林疏处数花明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56192,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"折梅","author":"张道洽","text":"日暮天寒小驿亭，竹边流水浅泠泠。\n一枝蚤落诗人手，无恨春风入胆瓶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56193,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其十一","author":"张道洽","text":"万里閒关庾岭回，岭头曾见此花来。\n远游何似在家好，屋角玲珑一树开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56194,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其十二","author":"张道洽","text":"数点疏花不满枝，倚栏惟恨月明迟。\n风流一段无人共，正是霜飞屋角时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56195,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其三","author":"张道洽","text":"疏花清晓嫩寒时，粉蝶霜禽总不知。\n未有风流如此老，为渠费尽雪桥诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56196,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其二","author":"张道洽","text":"此兄自是风尘表，半在山巅半水涯。\n老子怕寒浑不出，夜窗明月看横斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56197,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其九","author":"张道洽","text":"茶灶熏炉与笔床，黄昏待月在东厢。\n无人知得花清处，影落寒池水亦香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56198,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其五","author":"张道洽","text":"夜深月透小窗纱，梦到瑶池阿母家。\n急遣山僮开户看，不知是雪是梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56199,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其十三","author":"张道洽","text":"小小茅茨野老家，不随桃李竞春华。\n欲知格韵真孤绝，秃尽千林始一花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56200,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其十四","author":"张道洽","text":"正是天荒地老时，芙蓉憔悴菊离披。\n呼童试探溪南路，春到寒梅第几枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56201,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其四","author":"张道洽","text":"风流百世林和靖，洒落三生杨补之。\n一自阆风归去后，几回展画又观诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56202,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其一","author":"张道洽","text":"百馀年树未为古，三四点花何限春。\n欲折一枝无处赠，世间少有识花人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56203,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其十五","author":"张道洽","text":"南枝太蚤北枝迟，非蚤非迟恰好时。\n竹屋一痕微月照，老夫树下正吟诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56204,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其八","author":"张道洽","text":"昔年诗担过罗浮，曾见梅花一夕留。\n翠凤几回清夜梦，月明还挂旧枝头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56205,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其十","author":"张道洽","text":"不是梅花契分深，与谁共话岁寒心。\n隔溪竹外无人见，自有香来不用寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56206,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅杂诗 其七","author":"张道洽","text":"三生种植得梅缘，每见梅花辄欲颠。\n清梦化为蝴蝶去，也应只在此花边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56207,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岭梅","author":"张道洽","text":"到处皆诗境，随时有物华。\n应酬都不暇，一岭是梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56208,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瓶梅","author":"张道洽","text":"春在胆瓶閒，朝看复暮看。\n小屏遮护著，不怕玉肌寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56209,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瓶梅","author":"张道洽","text":"寒水一瓶春数枝，清香不减小溪时。\n横斜烛底无人见，莫与微云澹月知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56210,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嗅梅","author":"张道洽","text":"一夜吹香过别村，瘴江洗尽水云昏。\n真堪持作维摩供，鼻观微参透顶门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56211,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"照水梅","author":"张道洽","text":"照影寒溪水，溪中水也香。\n佳人临宝鉴，自作寿阳妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56212,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"墨梅","author":"张道洽","text":"一枝的的照人寒，绝胜溪桥立马看。\n祇恐东风解相怨，漏他消息入毫端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56213,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其四","author":"张道洽","text":"疏疏竹外枝，短短水边篱。\n南雪若相避，东风殊不知。\n兰荃皆弱植，桃杏总凡姿。\n坐叹逋仙远，清宵费梦思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56214,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其一","author":"张道洽","text":"朔风吹石裂，寒谷自春生。\n根老香全古，花疏格转清。\n园林千树秃，篱落一枝横。\n佩芷兼怀玉，悠然见此兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56215,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其五","author":"张道洽","text":"不带吟诗癖，缘何太瘦生。\n肌肤姑射白，风骨伯夷清。\n格外宫妆别，天然画轴横。\n涪翁太多可，唤作水仙兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56216,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其二十","author":"张道洽","text":"村墅苔为径，茅檐竹作篱。\n神清和月写，香远隔烟知。\n老树有馀韵，别花无此姿。\n诗人风味似，梦寐也应思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56217,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其九","author":"张道洽","text":"有月色逾淡，无风香自生。\n霜崖和树瘦，冰壑养花清。\n政尔疏还冷，忽然斜又横。\n千林成独韵，难弟又难兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56218,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十八","author":"张道洽","text":"子真同一性，和靖是三生。\n山意冷愈澹，月香幽更清。\n只应霜雁识，未怯玉龙横。\n密友惟清士，佳名称素兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56219,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其三","author":"张道洽","text":"半枯顽铁石，特地数花生。\n迥立风尘表，长含水月清。\n屋头寒岭瘦，门外小溪横。\n万里今为客，相看如弟兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56220,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其七","author":"张道洽","text":"不与百花竞，春风蓦地生。\n故将天下白，独向雪中清。\n我辈诗仍要，谁家笛自横。\n岁寒堪共老，髯叟十年兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56221,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十六","author":"张道洽","text":"突出一清枝，孤村雪拥篱。\n韵无凡眼识，香有自心知。\n不是神仙骨，何缘冰玉姿。\n看看金鼎实，此味几人思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56222,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其二","author":"张道洽","text":"苔封鹤膝枝，流水绕疏篱。\n一白雪相似，独清春不知。\n风流无俗韵，恬澹出天姿。\n霜月娟娟夜，吾今见所思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56223,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十五","author":"张道洽","text":"万壑寒皆冱，孤根暖自生。\n不随千卉艳，独负一身清。\n水际寒香迥，窗间夜影横。\n舆台桃李辈，谁弟又谁兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56224,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十","author":"张道洽","text":"雪后半横枝，溪边一带篱。\n春从穷腊透，香报老夫知。\n淡月弄疏影，嫩寒含令姿。\n天涯值西子，牢落慰吾思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十四","author":"张道洽","text":"春脚到寒枝，诗情满雪篱。\n每留孤鹤伴，不遣一蜂知。\n风漏腊前信，月描尘外姿。\n忆从归阆苑，终岁祇君思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其六","author":"张道洽","text":"苍虬百岁枝，残雪数家篱。\n点俗那能染，孤芳只自知。\n肯回桃李面，要是雪霜姿。\n不见紫芝久，悠悠使我思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其八","author":"张道洽","text":"何处出斜枝，茅檐自竹篱。\n首回春一盼，最与月相知。\n严冷冰霜面，清癯山泽姿。\n几番将鹤去，倚树说相思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十一","author":"张道洽","text":"殷勤天女供，那复一尘生。\n质淡全身白，香寒到骨清。\n常留雪中看，遮莫鬓边横。\n万古月宫桂，犹吾异姓兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十七","author":"张道洽","text":"参透香严境，都无灭与生。\n平分天女白，全借月娥清。\n雪屋人家好，霜桥野岸横。\n天寒倚修竹，齐弟伯夷兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十二","author":"张道洽","text":"古藓护疏枝，幽花发短篱。\n唯宜霜月照，莫遣雪风知。\n数点玲珑玉，三生洒落姿。\n自从窗外见，风味至今思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56231,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池州和同官咏梅花 其十三","author":"张道洽","text":"玉肌元不粟，未怕夜寒生。\n雪里孤花发，山中一段清。\n几回和月看，独立到参横。\n不傍人篱落，谁呼石作兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56232,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二十首 其六","author":"张道洽","text":"政尔寒阴惨淡时，忽逢孤艳映疏篱。\n金紫气味无人识，玉雪襟怀只自知。\n竹屋纸窗清不俗，茶瓯禅榻两相宜。\n花边不敢高声语，羌管凄凉更忍吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56233,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二十首 其十九","author":"张道洽","text":"爱疏爱淡爱枯枝，已爱梅花更爱奇。\n江路一年春好处，石桥半夜月明时。\n蹇驴积雪深须去，破帽严霜打不知。\n世上非无好颜色，诗人所赏是风姿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56234,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二十首 其二十","author":"张道洽","text":"癖爱梅花不可医，开教探早落教迟。\n欲知无限春风意，尽在相将暮雪时。\n竹屿烟深寻得巧，茅檐月淡立成痴。\n梦骖鸾鹤相寻去，题遍江南寺寺诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56235,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二十首 其十五","author":"张道洽","text":"才有梅花便不村，其人如玉立黄昏。\n些些蕊里藏风韵，个个枝头带月魂。\n常挹清香来燕坐，可教落片点空樽。\n到腰深雪庭前白，心事寒松拟共论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56236,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二十首 其九","author":"张道洽","text":"行尽荒林一径苔，竹稍深处数枝开。\n绝知南雪羞相并，欲嫁东风耻自媒。\n无主野桥随月管，有根寒谷也春回。\n醉馀不睡庭前地，只恐忽吹花落来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56237,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二十首 其七","author":"张道洽","text":"千林冻损积阴凝，一点春从底处生。\n玉色独钟天地正，铁心不受雪霜惊。\n孤芳若与东君背，数树能令南纪明。\n醉后惟愁踏花影，青鞋不敢近花行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56238,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二十首 其十","author":"张道洽","text":"天然标格阆风乡，薄薄铅华淡淡妆。\n月地向谁孤弄影，雪天蓦地忽闻香。\n征鞍处处频回首，羌管声声欲断肠。\n天上玉妃新谪堕，游蜂不敢近花傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56239,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]